WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.773
Narrator: The Police lead every suspicious-item incident.

2
00:00:03.873 --> 00:00:09.073
Narrator: Security confirm and support; Police and specialists deal with the item.

3
00:00:09.173 --> 00:00:13.410
Narrator: Your job is to watch, report and follow instructions.

4
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:24.167
Narrator: Move people away from the immediate area calmly, at once. A wider cordon and distances come on instruction.

5
00:00:24.267 --> 00:00:27.780
Narrator: And remember - deciding to evacuate is not your call.
